 to develop different strategies for each game with it's compelling game structure.<br><br>- Full gameplay with many types of enemies, mines and weapons.<br><br>- Mining Focused On Fragmentation Physics.<br><br>- Defeat the robot enemies that come upon you during gameplay and survive until you destroy the Great Mountains or survive till the end!<br><br>- Gather Supplies, gain experience and buy items in the shop between attacks!<br><br>- Accessibilty Options; Play as you like with the gamepad or keyboard and have fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/adc76e19ea91f6be21b102b3fd2c3cd7.poster.avif?t=1752249931\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/adc76e19ea91f6be21b102b3fd2c3cd7.webm?t=1752249931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/adc76e19ea91f6be21b102b3fd2c3cd7.mp4?t=1752249931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Physics and Fragmentation</strong><br>Space Digger features an advanced physics-based object fragmentation system. Shatter the ores to collect and sell the mineral resources extracted from within!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/867d8c92c5ca373aea67acc88590ccf4.poster.avif?t=1752249931\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/867d8c92c5ca373aea67acc88590ccf4.webm?t=1752249931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559680/extras/867d8c92c5ca373aea67acc88590ccf4.mp4?t=1752249931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","develope